          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Hazelnut paste}:\\text{cocoa}&=1.2:28\\\\\\text{Hazelnut paste}:\\text{cocoa}&=12:280\\\\\\text{Hazelnut paste}:\\text{cocoa}&=3:70\\end{align*}$$",
